# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets: never commit these. Tests generate keys and passwords at runtime.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.ppk
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
.env*
known_hosts
known_hosts.*
# Source module of the known hosts store (not a key file).
!/crates/core/src/known_hosts/
# Source of the Known Hosts screen and its integration test (not key files).
!/apps/desktop/src/known_hosts/
!/apps/desktop/tests/known_hosts.rs
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rust
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output; UI screenshots go to target/ui-screens/.
/target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
# Cargo.lock is committed (the workspace builds applications).

